      "party": "Democratic",
      "incumbent": true,
      "summary": "Stephen Lynch has represented Massachusetts's 8th Congressional District (previously the 9th) since 2001. A former ironworker and union president, he earned a law degree from Boston College and a Master's in Public Administration from Harvard. Lynch is the ranking member of the House Oversight Committee and sits on the Financial Services Committee; he has a reputation as a moderate Democrat and has been re-elected by wide margins.",
